      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test with better understandability — clearer variable names, separated setup/assertion phases, and explicit comments for each boundary condition.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version improves understandability by renaming `c` to `channel`, splitting the chained calls onto separate lines with descriptive variable names (`positionWithinData`, `positionAtEnd`, `positionPastEnd`), and adding brief inline comments that explain the three boundary conditions being tested (within data, exactly at end, and one past the end)."
